/// What this build's Leitmotif listens to, for the "What is this?" page.
enum Edition {
    static let name = "Ambit Name"
    static let leitmotifSource = "The names your iPhone looks up (instagram.com, icloud.com, app-measurement.com…), heard by a tunnel on the phone that carries only those lookups and passes them on to the resolver you choose. Everything else bypasses it untouched; names stay in memory, never on disk."
    static let leitmotifMapping = "Each service's domain seeds its own leitmotif of two to four notes, so every app and site always sounds like itself, and subdomains are variations on it. Apple and system traffic murmurs an octave lower; trackers, analytics and ads are whispered two octaves up. Download rate sets how hard the keys are struck, upload rate how much tape dust rides along."
}
